{{!
    @template local_vravatar/designer

    The "My VR avatar" designer: a 3D preview with its tools (presets, surprise me, undo and redo)
    and the choices on six tabs (head and face, hair, body, costume, hands, extras). Every choice is
    a real radio button or checkbox whose label is a picture tile (a large swatch for a colour), so
    keyboard and screen reader use is that of a plain form. The costumes are a wrapping grid of
    thumbnails by category, with the credits of the costume models. A save bar stays at the bottom
    of the screen.

    Without JavaScript every tab is shown as a headed section, tiles without a drawn picture show
    their name, and the form posts to the page. With it, local_vravatar/designer turns the sections
    into tabs (WAI-ARIA tabs), draws the tile pictures (data-render) with the avatar builder, draws
    the preview (loading the costume models named by the data-model attributes), saves through the
    web service and shows the tools, Reset, zoom (a toggle button, aria-pressed) and camera
    preview buttons.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none (data-region and data-action attributes)

    Context variables required for this template:
    * actionurl - where the form posts without JavaScript
    * sesskey - session key
    * sections - list of sections (tabs), each with id, tabid, heading, tablabel (the short name on
      the tab), icon (the tab's icon), frame (how the preview frames the avatar on this tab: face,
      whole or hands), first, isextras, ishands and items; an item is
      either a radio group (radio: name, id, legend, isswatch and options, each option with value,
      id, label, checked, swatch, follows, palette, model, credit, pic, mask and render), a checkbox
      (check: name, id, groupid, legend, label, checked and render) or the costume picker (costume:
      name, id, legend, none with value, id, label and checked, and categories, each with id, legend
      and options, each option with value, id, label, checked, thumb, model, credit and kind); the
      section with isextras also shows the picture checkbox
    * presets - the ready-made looks, each with id, name and json (the keys it sets)
    * haspresets - whether there are presets (they make the first tab, Looks)
    * looksicon - the Looks tab's icon
    * picture - whether the profile picture is chosen
    * pictureallowed - whether the site allows profile pictures on avatars
    * haspicture - whether the user has a profile picture to show
    * hasdesign - whether the user has saved a design
    * hascredits - whether there are costume credits to list
    * credits - the costume models' credits, each with name, title, credit and source (all
      costumes, whatever their licence)

    The example below never has two closing braces next to each other: they would end this
    comment early.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "actionurl": "https://example.org/local/vravatar/index.php",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "sections": [
            {
                "id": "local-vravatar-section-head",
                "tabid": "local-vravatar-section-head-tab",
                "heading": "Head and face",
                "tablabel": "Face",
                "icon": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/local_vravatar/1/tabs/face",
                "frame": "face",
                "first": true,
                "isextras": false,
                "ishands": false,
                "items": [
                    {
                        "radio": {
                            "name": "skin",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-group-skin",
                            "legend": "Skin tone",
                            "isswatch": true,
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "value": "match",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-skin-match",
                                    "label": "Same as body colour",
                                    "checked": true,
                                    "swatch": "",
                                    "follows": true,
                                    "palette": "skin",
                                    "pic": "",
                                    "mask": "",
                                    "render": ""
                                },
                                {
                                    "value": "medium",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-skin-medium",
                                    "label": "Medium",
                                    "checked": false,
                                    "swatch": "#c98e64",
                                    "follows": false,
                                    "palette": "skin",
                                    "pic": "",
                                    "mask": "",
                                    "render": ""
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "check": {
                            "name": "ears",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-ears",
                            "groupid": "local-vravatar-group-ears",
                            "legend": "Ears",
                            "label": "Show ears",
                            "checked": false,
                            "render": "face"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "id": "local-vravatar-section-extras",
                "tabid": "local-vravatar-section-extras-tab",
                "heading": "Extras",
                "tablabel": "Extras",
                "icon": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/local_vravatar/1/tabs/extras",
                "frame": "face",
                "first": false,
                "isextras": true,
                "ishands": false,
                "items": [
                    {
                        "radio": {
                            "name": "hat",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-group-hat",
                            "legend": "Hat",
                            "isswatch": false,
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "value": "none",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-hat-none",
                                    "label": "No hat",
                                    "checked": true,
                                    "swatch": "",
                                    "follows": false,
                                    "palette": "",
                                    "model": "",
                                    "credit": "",
                                    "pic": "",
                                    "mask": "",
                                    "render": "face"
                                },
                                {
                                    "value": "pirate",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-hat-pirate",
                                    "label": "Pirate hat",
                                    "checked": false,
                                    "swatch": "",
                                    "palette": "",
                                    "model": "https://example.org/local/vravatar/costumes/hat-pirate.glb",
                                    "credit": "by Poly by Google, CC BY 3.0",
                                    "follows": false,
                                    "pic": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/local_vravatar/1/costumes/hat-pirate",
                                    "mask": "",
                                    "render": ""
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "id": "local-vravatar-section-costume",
                "tabid": "local-vravatar-section-costume-tab",
                "heading": "Costume",
                "tablabel": "Costume",
                "icon": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/local_vravatar/1/tabs/costume",
                "frame": "whole",
                "first": false,
                "isextras": false,
                "ishands": false,
                "items": [
                    {
                        "costume": {
                            "name": "outfit",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-group-outfit",
                            "legend": "Costume",
                            "none": {
                                "value": "none",
                                "id": "local-vravatar-outfit-none",
                                "label": "No costume",
                                "checked": true
                            },
                            "categories": [
                                {
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-costumes-suit",
                                    "legend": "Suits",
                                    "options": [
                                        {
                                            "value": "suit-tie",
                                            "id": "local-vravatar-outfit-suit-tie",
                                            "label": "Suit and tie",
                                            "checked": false,
                                            "thumb": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/local_vravatar/1/costumes/suit-tie",
                                            "model": "https://example.org/local/vravatar/costumes/suit-tie.glb",
                                            "credit": "by Ian MacGillivray, CC BY 3.0",
                                            "kind": "body"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
